    "text/html": "<html xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-example-com:vml\"\nxmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-example-com:office\"\nxmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-example-com:processor\"\nxmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40\">\n\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\n<meta name=ProgId content=Processor.Document>\n<meta name=Generator content=\"Desktop word processor 16\">\n<meta name=Originator content=\"Desktop word processor 16\">\n<link rel=File-List\nhref=\"file:///Users/user/Library/Group%20Containers/clip/clip_filelist.xml\">\n<!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n <o:DocumentProperties>\n  <o:Author>Sample Author</o:Author>\n  <o:Template>Normal</o:Template>\n  <o:Revision>3</o:Revision>\n </o:DocumentProperties>\n <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\n  <o:AllowPNG/>\n </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\n</xml><![endif]-->\n<!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n <w:WordDocument>\n  <w:View>Normal</w:View>\n  <w:Zoom>0</w:Zoom>\n  <w:TrackMoves/>\n  <w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/>\n </w:WordDocument>\n</xml><![endif]-->\n<style>\n<!--\n /* Font Definitions */\n @font-face\n\t{font-family:\"Body Serif\";\n\tpanose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;\n\tmso-font-charset:0;\n\tmso-generic-font-family:roman;\n\tmso-font-pitch:variable;}\n /* Style Definitions */\n p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\n\t{mso-style-unhide:no;\n\tmso-style-qformat:yes;\n\tmso-style-parent:\"\";\n\tmargin-top:0in;\n\tmargin-right:0in;\n\tmargin-bottom:8.0pt;\n\tmargin-left:0in;\n\tline-height:107%;\n\tmso-pagination:widow-orphan;\n\tfont-size:12.0pt;\n\tfont-family:\"Body Serif\",serif;}\nh1\n\t{mso-style-priority:9;\n\tmso-style-qformat:yes;\n\tmso-style-link:\"Heading 1 Char\";\n\tmso-outline-level:1;\n\tfont-size:20.0pt;}\np.MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst, li.MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\n\t{mso-style-priority:34;\n\tmargin-left:.5in;\n\tmso-add-space:auto;}\n@list l0\n\t{mso-list-id:101;\n\tmso-list-type:hybrid;\n\tmso-list-template-ids:-1 67698703 67698713 67698715;}\n@list l0:level1\n\t{mso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;}\n.MsoChpDefault\n\t{mso-style-type:export-only;\n\tmso-default-props:yes;}\ndiv.Section1\n\t{page:Section1;}\n-->\n</style>\n<!--[if gte mso 10]>\n<style>\n /* Style Definitions */\n table.MsoNormalTable\n\t{mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\";\n\tmso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;\n\tmso-style-noshow:yes;\n\tmso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;}\n</style>\n<![endif]-->\n</head>\n\n<body lang=EN-US style='tab-interval:.5in;word-wrap:break-word'>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<div class=Section1>\n\n<h1><a name=\"_Toc000001\"></a><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:\"Body Serif\"'>Harbor Street Community Garden<o:p></o:p></span></h1>\n\n<p class=MsoSubtitle>Spring planning notes<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p class=MsoNormal>The committee met on <b><span style='mso-bidi-font-weight:\nnormal'>Thursday evening</span></b> to plan the <i>raised beds</i>, the <u>tool\nshed</u> and the <s>old</s> new compost area.<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;\n</span>Water use was 1.2 m<sup>3</sup> per week; the soil test read CO<sub>2</sub>\nlevels as normal.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<h2><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:\"Body Serif\"'>Decisions<o:p></o:p></span></h2>\n\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:center'><span style='font-size:14.0pt;\nline-height:107%;color:#2F5496;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-themeshade:191'>Plots open on <b>April\n4</b>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=MsoQuote>Grow what you will eat, and share what you cannot.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-bookmark:_Toc000001'></span><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!--EndFragment-->\n</body>\n\n</html>\n",
    "text/plain": "Harbor Street Community Garden\n\nSpring planning notes\n\nThe committee met on Thursday evening to plan the raised beds, the tool\nshed and the old new compost area.\nWater use was 1.2 m3 per week; the soil test read CO2\nlevels as normal.\n\nDecisions\n\nPlots open on April\n4.\n\nGrow what you will eat, and share what you cannot."
